# AGP — Match HUD Retreat runner icon

Create one production-ready, small HUD icon asset for the Retreat control in
Urkaaaz.

## Asset

- Filename: `match_hud_retreat_runner.png`
- Format: PNG with true transparency (RGBA)
- Canvas: square, 256 × 256 px
- Intended display size: 24 × 24 dp inside a 48 × 48 dp HUD control
- Keep the full silhouette within the central 80% of the canvas. Leave clear,
  even transparent padding on every side.

## Visual direction

Draw a bold, instantly readable silhouette of a generic human fleeing at a
sprint, seen in side profile and moving to the left. Use a forward-leaning
torso, a clearly separated head, and arms and legs in an unmistakable running
stride. Add at most two or three short, chunky motion marks trailing behind the
figure on the right to reinforce urgency and direction.

Use a single warm, muted ivory-gold fill that fits the existing match HUD,
approximately `#EFDCAF`. If needed for contrast at small sizes, use only a
subtle dark bronze edge, approximately `#705B39`; do not rely on a thin outline
to define the shape. Prefer solid, compact shapes over stick limbs or delicate
line work. All limbs and gaps must remain legible when the image is reduced to
24 × 24 px.

The result should feel like a restrained game HUD pictogram: clear and
purposeful, not cartoonish, decorative, or realistic. Match the existing HUD
icon weight and palette. Use the current match HUD screenshot as a scale and
contrast reference, and the integrated universal HUD frame only as a palette
reference; do not reproduce either in the asset.

## Do not include

- Any background, panel, button, circle, badge, border, frame, shadow, or glow.
- Text, letters, numbers, labels, arrows, logos, or faction symbols.
- Weapons, armor, facial features, clothing details, or a specific existing
  character/unit design.
- Thin speed lines, hairline limbs, gradients, texture, noise, or scenery.
- Multiple people or any additional interface elements.

## Acceptance checks

1. The transparent PNG contains only the icon artwork.
2. The figure is immediately recognizable as running away, not standing,
   walking, attacking, or celebrating.
3. Direction is clear at 24 × 24 px on the existing dark translucent HUD
   control.
4. The head, torso, arms, and legs remain distinguishable without tiny details.
5. The icon is balanced within its transparent canvas and is not cropped.
6. The asset is delivered as a single PNG, with no mockup or alternate
   variations.

## Project integration target

After visual review and approval, copy the source to
`assets_src/match/hud/match_hud_retreat_runner.png` and integrate it as
`android-app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/match_hud_retreat_runner.png`. Replace
the temporary `RETREAT` text in the control only after the generated icon is
approved.
